  One commit, [38;5;153minitial: empty tasks page[39m. There is no task model, no user model, no persistence, no backend, no
  framework. "Notify users when tasks they care about change" presupposes all four of those:

  - [1mTasks[0m — there is nothing to change yet
  - [1mUsers[0m — there is nobody to notify, and no "care about" relationship
  - [1mChange events[0m — nothing emits them
