  That's not me being pedantic about a missing file. It means almost every real decision about notifications — what a
  change event looks like, where subscriptions live, whether delivery is in-page or out-of-band — is downstream of
  decisions nobody has made yet. If I design notifications now against an imagined task model, the design gets rewritten
  the moment the real one lands.

  So my first question is about which of those two worlds we're in.
